01:16:45.875 --> 01:16:48.537
Why don't we just go back?


01:16:49.708 --> 01:16:51.949
Instead of dying a graveless death,


01:16:53.208 --> 01:16:54.948
at least back at home,


01:16:55.042 --> 01:16:57.249
