01:17:42.000 --> 01:17:43.615
It's like a virus.


01:17:44.708 --> 01:17:46.289
It's also a disaster.


01:17:51.083 --> 01:17:53.495
But why can't we reject it?


01:17:53.833 --> 01:17:55.851
